    "sourceHash": "90ddf19",
    "sameAsSourceJustification": "macOS Vietnamese keeps the loanword \"tab\" for a UI tab: Finder vi \"Hiển thị Tất cả Tab\" and \"Ẩn Thanh Tab\", Safari vi \"Tab mới\" / \"Đóng tab\" / \"Ghim tab\" (macOS 26.6.2, per-nib MenuBar.strings, verified 2026-08-30). The menu title IS that word, so it matches English by evidence, not by omission. \"Thẻ\" is reserved for a Finder tag."
